{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55424","headline":"句 · 陈贶","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"醒眼看诸峰，白云开又集。\n（见《能改斋漫录》卷八。\n）（按：中华上编本《能改斋漫录》引此作「五代时陈况诗」，「况」爲「贶」之误，郑方坤《五代诗话》卷三所引不误。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈贶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55424.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55424","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}